3. Modifications (AGPL-3.0 section 5(b))

This is a rebranded derivation named POPOPX. The complete change history of
this repository records every modification; the material steps are:

- 2026-11-11, commit e9ca9df6 - 241 paths renamed: source directories and
  Haskell modules (`src/Simplex` to `src/Popopx`), protocol documents, scripts,
  packaging files and the package name (`simplexmq` to `popopxmq`).
- 2026-11-11, commit d1ae1af4 - 412 files, 4071 lines: brand strings replaced
  (simplex -> popopx, Simplex -> Popopx, SimpleX -> POPOPX, SIMPLEX -> POPOPX),
  excluding GitHub URLs to the upstream organisation, ./LICENSE and the notices
  listed in section 2.
- 2026-11-12 - 23 links into this repository's own renamed documents repaired;
  application identifiers updated (apple-app-site-association appID, assetlinks
  package name, APNs topic and team defaults, Play Store links); the xftp web
  bundle rebuilt from source; this notice added.

Modifications that change behaviour or interoperability, not just names:

- Service URI scheme is `popopx:` instead of the upstream scheme
  (src/Popopx/Messaging/ServiceScheme.hs).
- Key-derivation label strings were changed to `POPOPX*` - `POPOPXSbChainInit`,
  `POPOPXSbChain`, `POPOPXX3DH`, `POPOPXVerifyCode`, `POPOPXRootRatchet`,
  `POPOPXChainRatchet`, `POPOPXContactLink`, `POPOPXInvLink`, `POPOPXService` -
  and the BBS badge header to `POPOPX badges v1`. These derivations do NOT
  interoperate with upstream servers or agents, and data produced under the
  upstream labels cannot be decrypted by this version, or the reverse.
- Prometheus metric names are `popopx_smp_*`.
- Preset server hostnames are `smp*.popopx.im` and `xftp*.popopx.im`. The
  server public keys and .onion addresses embedded with those hostnames are
  still the upstream ones, so the presets do not resolve to POPOPX-operated
  services yet.
- Docker image organisation is `popopxchat`; installation paths are
  `/etc/popopx`, `/etc/popopx-xftp` and `/var/lib/popopx`, and the server
  management scripts are `popopx-servers-*`.

Intentionally not changed: the SQLite user-defined function
`simplex_xor_md5_combine` (src/Popopx/Messaging/Agent/Store/SQLite.hs). Its name
is persisted inside existing database triggers, so renaming it would break
databases that were already created.


4. Corresponding source (AGPL-3.0 section 13)

Users who interact remotely with a modified server offered by this work are
provided the complete corresponding source, which is this repository:

  https://github.com/popopx-chat/popopxmq

This includes the build scripts and the sources of generated artifacts that are
distributed with the binaries. The xftp web bundle served by xftp-server
(apps/xftp-server/static/xftp-web-bundle/) is generated, never hand-edited: it is
produced from xftp-web/ with

  npm install && npm run build && npm run build:prod

and the files `index.js`, `crypto.worker.js` and `index.css` from
xftp-web/dist-web/assets/ are copied into the bundle directory.


